## 6. Directory Structure & Key Files

When replicating this workspace, structure your directory layout exactly as follows:

```text
aegis-master/
├── src/
│   ├── agents/
│   │   ├── triage.ts          # Distressed transcription parsing & landmarks extraction
│   │   └── logistics.ts       # Emergency unit assignment & audit log creation
│   ├── app/
│   │   ├── api/
│   │   │   ├── coordinate/
│   │   │   │   └── stream/
│   │   │   │       └── route.ts  # Master coordinator routing & SSE streaming engine
│   │   │   ├── events/
│   │   │   │   └── route.ts      # Database CRUD API (with REST/TLS fallbacks)
│   │   │   ├── intel/
│   │   │   │   └── fetch/
│   │   │   │       └── route.ts  # Live scrapers (News & Social Media APIs)
│   │   │   └── weather/
│   │   │       ├── current/
│   │   │       └── forecast/
│   │   ├── page.tsx           # Premium Cyberpunk HUD UI layout
│   │   └── layout.tsx
│   ├── components/
│   │   ├── TacticalMap.tsx    # 3D cinematic camera, custom markers, CRT overlays
│   │   ├── ReasoningLog.tsx   # Live typewriter streaming monologues & background tasks
│   │   ├── SignalFeed.tsx     # Active incident listing, scrolling cards
│   │   └── MissionReportModal.tsx # Post-crisis consolidated briefing summaries
│   ├── lib/
│   │   ├── store.ts           # Zustand store (persisted, cross-tab synced)
│   │   ├── data-fetching-layer.ts # News api, social API, HTML image scrapers
│   │   ├── weather-layer.ts   # Live weather condition and alerts scraper
│   │   ├── gemini-client.ts   # AI model clients
│   │   └── types.ts           # System-wide typescript definitions
│   └── seed/
│       ├── pakistan_city_area_topics.json # Dataset of cities, areas, coordinates, and topics
│       └── supabase_scan_events.sql       # Database schema setup queries
├── package.json
└── tailwind.config.js
```

This master architecture enables the system to scale to thousands of incoming crisis events, maintain non-blocking visual rendering in the browser, spatially cross-verify human voice calls with sat telemetry, filter out outdated topics, and provide commanders with a cinematic, glass-morphic situation room.
